        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "words": 55,
      "text": "However, in [the] spiritual image itself it shall live and be joined with [lo]ng-sufferingness, the perfection of faith and love that reigns over them all. It is the virgin of light who robes the new man and who shall be cal[l]ed ‘the hour of life’. S[he] is the f[irst], but s[h]e is also the last.",
